# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Files deliberately kept out of this repository, each for a stated reason.
# Nothing here is accidental. See README section "What is not in this repo".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The source register. A Government of India publication whose redistribution
# terms are not stated. scripts/00a_fetch_source.py downloads it and verifies
# its SHA-256, so reproduction does not depend on it being stored here.
data_raw/20251231_NGPL.pdf
data_raw/legacy_v0/20251231_NGPL.pdf

# GeoNames gazetteer. 69.6 MB, above GitHub's comfortable file size, and
# scripts/00b_fetch_gazetteer.py retrieves it with a recorded checksum.
data_raw/external/gazetteer/

# OpenStreetMap-derived outputs. OSM is licensed ODbL, which carries a
# share-alike obligation on a redistributed derived database. Rather than
# place that obligation on this whole package, these are excluded; both are
# regenerated by scripts/05 and scripts/06, and the paper reports only the
# summary finding, not the files.
gis/osm_pipelines_raw.geojson
data_processed/osm_pipeline_survey.csv
data_processed/facility_candidates.csv

# Hazard layers, not yet part of this release.
data_raw/external/seismic/
data_raw/external/population/
data_raw/external/flood/
data_raw/external/boundaries/

# Manuscript drafts belong with the manuscript, not in the data package.
PAPER_*.md
PAPER_*.docx
PAPER_*.pdf

# Ordinary noise
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
~$*
